sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant App as Application
    participant Lib as CUDA runtime
    participant Drv as Kernel driver
    participant IOMMU as IOMMU
    participant GPU as GPU
    App->>Lib: allocate device memory
    Lib->>Drv: ioctl
    Drv->>IOMMU: map pages for device access
    IOMMU-->>Drv: device addresses
    App->>Lib: copy host to device
    Lib->>GPU: DMA transfer over PCIe
    Note over Lib,GPU: pinned host memory avoids a bounce buffer and roughly doubles effective bandwidth
    App->>Lib: launch kernel
    Lib->>GPU: enqueue on a stream
    GPU-->>Lib: asynchronous — the CPU does not wait
    App->>Lib: synchronise
    Lib-->>App: results copied back
    Note over App,GPU: the bottleneck is almost always memory bandwidth, not compute
